# Secrets - never commit real values. Anything matching these stays out of the
# repo; the two deliberate exceptions are the .env.example templates (empty
# values) and frontend/.env.production (a public API URL, not a credential).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production
*.local

*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets.json
*credentials*.json
service-account*.json

